OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do pipes burst in heatwaves -
OL,4,Aand what can be done?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurst water mains, dwindling supplies
OL,7,Fand hosepipe bans across the West of
OL,8,FEngland are just a few issues caused by
OL,9,Fthis year's scorching summer.
OL,11,FOn 18 August, a major road was closed
OL,12,Fin Cheltenham after a burst main sent a
OL,13,F"raging river" down the street,
OL,14,Fthreatening to flood residents' homes.
OL,16,FTwo days later, a burst main on the
OL,17,Fedge of Bristol impacted nearly 1,500
OL,18,Fhomes, severing the water supply for
OL,19,Fmuch of the day.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
