OL,3,GNEWSAWhy do pipes burst in heatwaves -
OL,4,Aand what can be done?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWater companies said they were
OL,7,Fcontinually repairing leaks and
OL,8,Freplacing degrading pipes but, as
OL,9,Fclimate change brings more extreme
OL,10,Fweather, experts are calling for
OL,11,Frenewed infrastructure and a more
OL,12,Fresilient, sustainable approach.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
